{"3317390": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Magic Scavenger", "steam_appid": 3317390, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >《Magic Scavenger Demo》includes:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full Game Experience</strong>: You can freely explore the map</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lootable Items</strong>: Dozens of items available for scavenging</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enemy Types</strong>: Currently features 2 enemy variants</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay: </strong>Freely explore the map with no mandatory quests - just explore as you wish</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You arrive at an unfamiliar continent, free to explore this medieval land. While scavenging items across the map, you'll also encounter potential enemies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Free Exploration</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can freely explore the map with no storylines to complete and no mandatory quests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Loot Treasures</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The map is scattered with various items - you may pick and keep any treasures you fancy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Enemies lurking in the dark night</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must face the enemies hidden in the night—they will be your greatest obstacle. Once they spot you, they will give chase!</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >《Magic Scavenger Demo》includes:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full Game Experience</strong>: You can freely explore the map</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lootable Items</strong>: Dozens of items available for scavenging</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p cl